<view class="page"><view class="subject-banner"><text>就诊人：{{patientName||'请先选择'}}</text><view>{{patientCapacity}}</view><navigator url="/pages/patients/index" open-type="reLaunch">切换就诊人</navigator></view><view class="brand">就诊协助</view><view class="title">让前台帮您协调</view><view class="card"><view class="label">没有合适时段</view><view>可调整日期、医师偏好，或登记候补意向。收到邀约并明确接受后才成约。</view><navigator class="link" url="/pages/waitjoin/index">登记候补偏好 →</navigator><navigator class="link" url="/pages/waitlist/index">查看候补进展 →</navigator><view class="label">提交后连接中断</view><view>先刷新“我的预约”或“我的候补”，核对是否已经保存。不要为了重试另选时段重复预约。</view><view class="label">已经到诊或接近就诊时间</view><view>请联系原诊所前台协助，不自行更改治疗记录或费用。</view></view>
<view wx:for="{{clinics}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="time">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.postal_address}}</view><view>前台电话 {{item.phone}}</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!clinics.length}}" class="notice">登录后可查看门店地址与前台电话。无法登录时，请通过门店已公布的联系方式咨询。</view><navigator class="link" url="/pages/services/index">查看服务内容</navigator><navigator class="link" open-type="reLaunch" url="/pages/login/index">返回登录或我的预约</navigator><view wx:if="{{environmentLabel}}" class="page-footnote">{{environmentLabel}}</view></view>
